{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"d0411e23d5dbdc8d351b931cc4fe1c5056a0c447e79232b3f3f34f6ad70f1e72","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_a416aceb4cce1a5b7a8c5e4bc2a5b8ba0f1102200a09f925b7e4b1ec616fc7fd","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical contribution to document representation learning without addressing policy, compliance, or ethical considerations. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine the paper's adherence to specific data privacy, anonymity, plagiarism, or broader impact policies, as no such statements or external policy frameworks are present in the text.","paper_id":"B1Igu2ogg","paper_identity_sha256":"3696103dd83e30d790044b849dadd1c37e324386b82c04b0124fa993d9a629b6","prompt_identity_sha256":"6e2faeb3e136fab1c53c2ae17fef14696ba6be3a5b5a62f61a9ad0862629a5de","raw_response_sha256":"03bfdf5d1d4f85d4b4bbc1aff57ab6ed94fcdbff200000056948f494050460c8","request_identity_sha256":"5777f3634b6f3db7a6ffb5e4a31b49c878a19a74d9a87b83bf823d49da7e17f8","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"5437ae772fd01d90cdce9afe503559c28ca64d281d16679be3fc84e0a0b26961","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not discuss ethical risks, fairness, bias, or potential harms associated with the Doc2VecC model. There is no mention of dual-use concerns or mitigation strategies for negative societal impacts. The evidence provided is limited to the technical methodology and experimental results, offering no basis to evaluate ethical compliance.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-024","SRC-031","SRC-036"],"review_text":"The paper utilizes several datasets, including IMDB movie reviews, a subset of Wikipedia, and the SICK dataset. While the sources are cited, the paper does not explicitly discuss data licensing, privacy compliance, or consent for the use of these datasets. The evidence is insufficient to determine whether the data usage adheres to specific privacy regulations or licensing terms.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper explicitly lists the author's name, affiliation (Criteo Research), and email address on the title page. Without a frozen venue-specific anonymity policy, it is not possible to determine if this constitutes a violation of double-blind review rules. The visible identification is noted, but no policy judgment can be made based on the supplied evidence.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not contain any disclosures regarding plagiarism, self-plagiarism, or dual submission. The supplied evidence does not include external overlap checks or prior publication records. Therefore, it is impossible to verify the originality of the content or the absence of dual submission based solely on the provided text.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not include a broader impact statement, a responsible AI checklist, or any documentation of IRB/ethics approvals. There is no discussion of the societal implications of the model or compliance with specific policy requirements for such disclosures. The evidence is insufficient to assess the paper's adherence to broader impact reporting standards.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"bf748435bbbe3be17b44d9ec73f1d78129d697234e6599ccd0c8815d916da5e7","paper_id":"B1Igu2ogg","paper_ordinal":7,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"03bfdf5d1d4f85d4b4bbc1aff57ab6ed94fcdbff200000056948f494050460c8","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"B1Igu2ogg","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"c469abafa2ae885c287e3859459182251c7699897f3c42d74ca99e3e820321c0","request_identity_sha256":"5